{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":426,"mirrow":false,"y":-34,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":426,"mirrow":false,"y":-34,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]你问我自卫团的事？在自卫团做的事还挺有趣的，完全不会感觉枯燥。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]之前在魔物途径的山路上铺了陷阱，正好碰到几只恐兽游荡过来，你猜怎么着？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]恐兽居然真的会扑棱翅膀，哈哈哈哈哈哈！结果扑棱半天还是掉了下去，乐死我了。[r]顺带一提恐兽肉其实挺鲜嫩的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]除了这些乐子，能保护村民们这事确实也挺有成就感的。[r]山村资源匮乏，有时候要从荒野客或者路过的佣兵团之类的人那里抢物资。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]自己人都快没饭吃了，我还管什么外人。[r]要不是物尽其用，在那种荒山野岭里根本养不起一村子人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"皮塔-熟识","script":"yd_014_05"}